## Before making changes

1. Read `.cursor/rules/karpathy.mdc` — think first, simplify, surgical changes.
2. Read `.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc` — feature structure, API patterns.
3. Read `.cursor/rules/design-system.mdc` — shadcn/ui conventions.

## Adding a feature

Follow `.cursor/skills/add-feature-web/SKILL.md` step-by-step.
Always run `npm run build` to verify before finishing.

## Key conventions

- API calls go through `src/api/client.ts` (axios, auto-unwraps `{data}` envelope).
- UI: shadcn components in `src/components/ui/` — run `npx shadcn@latest add` for new primitives.
- Auth state in `useAuthStore`. Home (`/`) is public by default.

## Verification

```bash
npm run build   # must pass before any PR
npm run dev     # local dev on http://localhost:5173
```
